WEBVTT

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.976
No looting, no military disappearing,

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.048
no arms disappearing,
no ammo disappearing,

00:09:04.072 --> 00:09:06.311
no Muqtada Al-Sadr -- I'm
wrecking his bones --

00:09:06.335 --> 00:09:07.976
no insurgency.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.976
Talk to anybody who was over there
in the first six months.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.976
We had six months to feel
the lob, to get the job done,

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.976
and we dicked around for six months.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.976
And then they turned on us.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.976
Why? Because they just got fed up.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.976
They saw what we did to Saddam.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.976
They said, "You're that powerful,
you can resurrect this country.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.976
You're America."

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.976
What we need is an international
reconstruction fund --

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.239
Sebastian Mallaby,
Washington Post, great idea.

00:09:29.263 --> 00:09:30.976
Model on the IMF.